title: "Recoverability after Knowledge Invalidation: Contingent Safety Budgets and the Limits of Observable Evidence"
authors:
  - family-names: Miyamoto
    given-names: Yukitake
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher, Japan"
version: "0.6.1"
url: "https://github.com/k3ijo-miyamoto/knowledge-recoverability/blob/main/paper/knowledge_recoverability_v0.6.1.pdf"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A finite decision-theoretic characterization of safe, warranted knowledge
  recovery under exact verification, old-version quarantine, dependent
  witness validity, and a hard worst-path action budget. This is a working
  preprint; external peer review and independent mathematical certification
  are not claimed.
